<title>DENMARK: Denmark's KommuneKredit ups 4 pct 2002 bond amount.</title>
<headline>Denmark's KommuneKredit ups 4 pct 2002 bond amount.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark's KommuneKredit has increased by 100 million crowns the amount of its existing four percent 2002 bond, to a total 1.858815 billion crowns, arranger Gudme Raaschou said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It added that all the bonds had been sold. --Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
</text>
